  "assetNotes": {
    "webpFilesAreHashed": "Each published WebP is also listed as a landing-review dependency so manual optimization or replacement receives a visual review.",
    "guideRoutes": "Each listed guide slug contributes its Markdown file as a landing-review dependency for that screenshot; the shared guide renderer and UI screenshot registry are also dependencies. Screenshot hero assets also appear as guide hub thumbnails on /resources.",
    "excludedWebSeed": "The web app's development-event-images.ts and scripts/seed/assets describe a separate wedding seed. Native screenshot capture uses the bundled BirthdayMarketingFixtures.swift fixture and does not run web database or server seeds. development-profile-images.ts documents some shared stock portrait source URLs, but native captures use bundled Marketing* asset copies offline; editing those seed files does not change these screenshots.",
    "separateSeoPhotos": "Guide photo images and stock photo attribution records are maintained separately from these eight UI screenshots."
  },
